11
00:02:55,300 --> 00:02:56,080
Pingjun.

12
00:02:56,919 --> 00:02:58,240
Want me to get the door?

13
00:02:59,699 --> 00:03:00,259
Pingjun!

14
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,180
That's a good girl.

15
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:36,500
You know I keep

16
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:38,099
