23
00:04:18,939 --> 00:04:19,819
Yu Changxuan.

24
00:04:22,819 --> 00:04:24,500
What exactly do you want?

25
00:04:26,500 --> 00:04:27,240
Kiss me.

26
00:04:38,220 --> 00:04:39,019
Don't cry.

27
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:43,939
If I don't cry,

28
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:47,660
