35
00:05:19,339 --> 00:05:20,259
Yu Changxuan.

36
00:05:23,079 --> 00:05:24,579
Listen carefully.

37
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,079
I won't consider

38
00:05:28,079 --> 00:05:30,040
