43
00:05:41,439 --> 00:05:43,600
I never liked you from the start.

44
00:05:45,100 --> 00:05:45,939
I hate you.

45
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:50,420
General?

46
00:06:50,860 --> 00:06:51,680
Lieutenant.

47
00:06:52,300 --> 00:06:53,100
What are you doing here?

48
00:06:54,180 --> 00:06:55,180
I'm looking for Pingjun.

49
00:06:55,379 --> 00:06:55,879
She said

50
00:06:56,100 --> 00:06:57,639
