is reliability.

60
00:07:32,319 --> 00:07:33,740
You have to care for her

61
00:07:34,319 --> 00:07:37,220
and be able to protect her.

62
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:40,800
Lieutenant Jiang,

63
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:43,120
you'd best get your act together.

64
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:45,939
Stop letting other men put their hands

65
