87
00:09:43,639 --> 00:09:44,960
A feast for the eyes.

88
00:09:45,279 --> 00:09:46,279
You little rascal.

89
00:09:46,659 --> 00:09:47,240
You're riding high

90
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:48,779
