93
00:09:53,919 --> 00:09:55,279
You actually got Major Yang

94
00:09:55,460 --> 00:09:56,240
to back you.

95
00:09:56,799 --> 00:09:58,360
That's a huge reassurance

96
00:09:58,360 --> 00:09:59,539
