108
00:10:22,519 --> 00:10:23,019
I'll stop there.

109
00:10:23,019 --> 00:10:24,460
Come take a look at my flowers.

110
00:10:26,519 --> 00:10:27,600
This is the crabapple.

111
00:10:28,100 --> 00:10:29,120
This is the kerria.

112
00:10:29,379 --> 00:10:30,340
This is the yellow rose.

113
00:10:30,899 --> 00:10:31,960
They all pair well

114
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:32,759
