119
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:06,340
That one's a hosta.

120
00:11:06,600 --> 00:11:07,960
The purest and cleanest of all.

121
00:11:08,379 --> 00:11:08,879
It gives off

122
00:11:08,879 --> 00:11:10,039
