123
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:11,879
If you like it,

124
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:13,360
I'll dig it up and let you grow it.

125
00:11:15,519 --> 00:11:16,120
Forget it.

126
00:11:17,639 --> 00:11:18,879
I've never been good with flowers.

127
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:20,539
I wouldn't even know

128
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:23,460
