129
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:25,639
Growing flowers is like loving someone.

130
00:11:26,039 --> 00:11:27,779
You have to figure out its nature.

131
00:11:28,700 --> 00:11:30,620
Give it as much sun and rain

132
00:11:31,379 --> 00:11:32,320
as it needs.

133
00:11:33,879 --> 00:11:34,879
Not a drop more.

134
00:11:35,879 --> 00:11:36,779
Not a bit less.

135
00:11:50,860 --> 00:11:51,740
Yu Changxuan.

136
00:11:53,279 --> 00:11:54,840
Listen carefully.

137
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:56,539
I will never in my life

138
00:11:58,860 --> 00:12:00,600
have anything to do

139
00:12:01,379 --> 00:12:02,779
with someone like you.

140
00:12:10,460 --> 00:12:12,600
Here. This one's for you.

141
00:12:13,379 --> 00:12:14,279
This one's for you.

142
00:12:15,340 --> 00:12:16,940
- Thanks, Pingjun.
- Thanks, Pingjun.

143
00:12:17,279 --> 00:12:18,100
Go on and play.

144
00:12:21,379 --> 00:12:22,200
Pingjun,

145
00:12:22,340 --> 00:12:23,019
you ordered

146
00:12:23,019 --> 00:12:24,240
so many more books for the kids.

147
00:12:24,240 --> 00:12:26,000
You really are too generous.

148
00:12:26,940 --> 00:12:28,600
Seeing them this happy

149
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:30,519
makes it all worth it.

150
00:12:32,500 --> 00:12:34,000
By the way, did you hear?

151
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:35,700
Nanhuai merchants announced

152
00:12:35,700 --> 00:12:36,480
they can't discriminate

153
00:12:36,480 --> 00:12:37,779
against refugees in any way.

154
00:12:38,240 --> 00:12:40,000
Before, without household registration,

155
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:41,500
they could only take temporary work.

156
00:12:41,740 --> 00:12:42,519
Now the longest

157
00:12:42,519 --> 00:12:43,860
can be extended to a year.

158
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:47,039
The household registry office will announce

159
00:12:47,039 --> 00:12:48,539
that anyone who's worked here for 5 years,

160
00:12:48,600 --> 00:12:50,340
abides by the law, and keeps a clean record

161
00:12:50,379 --> 00:12:51,620
can apply for Nanhuai residency

162
00:12:51,639 --> 00:12:52,860
and become an official resident.

163
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:53,440
Yes.

164
00:12:53,879 --> 00:12:55,059
It's all thanks to Young Master Changxuan

165
00:12:55,059 --> 00:12:56,240
mediating behind the scenes

166
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:57,779
that the city government finally caved.

167
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:05,039
What's wrong?

168
00:13:05,639 --> 00:13:06,399
What are you thinking about?

169
00:13:09,100 --> 00:13:09,860
Nothing.

170
00:13:10,860 --> 00:13:13,240
By the way, where's Xiaomu?

171
00:13:13,519 --> 00:13:15,259
He's usually the liveliest of them all.

172
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:16,779
How come I haven't seen him today?

173
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:19,019
He's in the backyard.

174
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:20,340
Sulking.

175
00:13:22,700 --> 00:13:23,940
What's wrong with him?

176
00:13:25,639 --> 00:13:27,240
Today's Xiaomu's birthday.

177
00:13:28,340 --> 00:13:29,860
When his parents were still around,

178
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:30,700
