179
00:13:30,700 --> 00:13:32,379
throw him a big celebration.

180
00:13:32,940 --> 00:13:33,879
But now...

181
00:13:37,360 --> 00:13:38,840
The first batch of funding has gone

182
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:39,940
