191
00:13:52,940 --> 00:13:54,320
Have our people learn fast.

192
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:55,639
Need to make our own guns and cannons.

193
00:13:55,879 --> 00:13:56,860
Can't keep relying on foreigners.

194
00:13:57,700 --> 00:13:58,620
I need your help with something.

195
00:13:58,620 --> 00:13:59,340
Don't be so formal.

196
00:13:59,340 --> 00:13:59,860
What can I

197
00:13:59,860 --> 00:14:00,679
help you with?

198
00:14:01,299 --> 00:14:02,320
This afternoon at 5,

199
00:14:02,840 --> 00:14:03,620
Pingjun and I

200
00:14:03,679 --> 00:14:04,740
are going to celebrate the orphans'

201
00:14:04,740 --> 00:14:05,460
birthdays

202
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:06,960
and then hit the temple fair together.

203
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:09,000
So I need you to translate

204
00:14:09,279 --> 00:14:10,480
these documents for me.

205
00:14:10,840 --> 00:14:11,500
No problem.

206
00:14:11,620 --> 00:14:13,000
I'll file them for you once I'm done.

207
00:14:13,340 --> 00:14:14,360
Thanks, Yingmei.

208
00:14:24,740 --> 00:14:25,179
Xueting,

209
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:26,059
