213
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:31,379
These are the newly arrived

214
00:14:31,379 --> 00:14:33,019
original files on the carbine.

215
00:14:33,259 --> 00:14:34,379
The tech department needs them urgently.

216
00:14:34,519 --> 00:14:35,240
They have to be

217
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:36,620
fully translated tonight.

218
00:14:37,100 --> 00:14:37,940
Take a look.

219
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:39,100
Sorry.

220
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:39,879
I appreciate it.

221
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:40,820
Chief.

222
00:14:41,240 --> 00:14:41,919
I'd like to

223
00:14:41,919 --> 00:14:43,500
pull some files

224
00:14:43,500 --> 00:14:44,519
from the archives tonight.

225
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:46,279
No problem. I'll write you a pass.

226
00:14:52,440 --> 00:14:53,440
What rotten luck.

227
00:14:54,879 --> 00:14:55,320
Yingmei,

228
00:14:55,720 --> 00:14:56,740
after you finish translating,

229
00:14:57,019 --> 00:14:58,000
help me run to the temple fair

230
00:14:58,120 --> 00:14:59,019
and let Pingjun know.

231
00:14:59,120 --> 00:14:59,539
Sure.

232
00:14:59,639 --> 00:15:00,379
Don't worry.

233
00:15:11,940 --> 00:15:13,000
Called in for overtime?

234
00:15:13,700 --> 00:15:14,759
The Chief made him stay.

235
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:15,720
He really couldn't get out of it.

236
00:15:15,919 --> 00:15:16,659
Xueting asked me

237
00:15:16,659 --> 00:15:17,480
to come tell you right away.

238
00:15:18,779 --> 00:15:19,940
Alright, I got it.

239
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:20,559
Sorry to trouble you.

240
00:15:20,740 --> 00:15:21,860
Don't mention it. Message delivered.

241
00:15:21,860 --> 00:15:23,159
I'll head back now.

242
00:15:23,360 --> 00:15:24,000
Thanks.

243
00:15:24,019 --> 00:15:24,519
No problem.

244
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:29,039
Let's go.

245
00:15:29,179 --> 00:15:30,240
I'll take you in.

246
00:15:30,840 --> 00:15:31,159
Go.

247
00:15:31,700 --> 00:15:33,179
Let's go.

248
00:15:38,740 --> 00:15:39,360
Xiaomu.

249
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:44,720
Changxuan!

250
00:15:45,740 --> 00:15:47,879
Happy birthday, Xiaomu.

251
00:15:52,460 --> 00:15:53,460
