254
00:16:01,860 --> 00:16:02,320
Let's go.

255
00:16:02,679 --> 00:16:03,440
We're celebrating your birthday.

256
00:16:03,759 --> 00:16:05,139
Mr. Yu, you're busy with official business.

257
00:16:05,379 --> 00:16:06,440
I'll keep Xiaomu company.

258
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:07,620
You should head back.

259
00:16:10,139 --> 00:16:10,879
