266
00:17:00,100 --> 00:17:01,559
A good likeness brings good luck.

267
00:17:03,799 --> 00:17:04,400
Pingjun,

268
00:17:04,400 --> 00:17:05,900
I want that little wooden horse.

269
00:17:09,700 --> 00:17:11,200
You want that little wooden horse?

270
00:17:14,180 --> 00:17:14,759
Let's join in.

271
00:17:15,500 --> 00:17:16,319
It's his birthday.

272
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:25,859
Fine.

273
00:18:10,460 --> 00:18:11,240
How is it?

274
00:18:11,579 --> 00:18:12,440
Doesn't it look just like him?

275
00:18:13,839 --> 00:18:15,660
It doesn't look like Liang Shanbo at all.

276
00:18:16,200 --> 00:18:16,819
More like

277
00:18:16,819 --> 00:18:18,339
