278
00:18:18,700 --> 00:18:20,519
What's so bad about Ma Wencai?

279
00:18:21,240 --> 00:18:22,900
Personally, I think Liang Shanbo

280
00:18:22,900 --> 00:18:24,039
is wishy-washy.

281
00:18:30,500 --> 00:18:32,200
When you want a girl,

282
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:34,579
