00:19:09,660 --> 00:19:10,519
Young Master,

294
00:19:11,740 --> 00:19:13,240
love

295
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:15,079
is about mutual willingness.

296
00:19:15,660 --> 00:19:16,660
You can't force it.

297
00:19:21,900 --> 00:19:23,140
I want to force it.

298
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:25,539
And I want to fight for it.

299
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:32,440
Dear,

300
00:19:33,240 --> 00:19:34,839
if I could walk you those eighteen li,

301
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:37,460
I'd follow every step.

302
00:19:38,539 --> 00:19:40,019
I'd never give you the chance

303
00:19:41,660 --> 00:19:42,960
to be promised to another.

304
00:19:46,960 --> 00:19:47,819
Xiaomu, it's getting late.

305
00:19:47,819 --> 00:19:48,500
Let me take you home.

306
00:21:33,819 --> 00:21:34,660
Young Master,

307
00:21:36,019 --> 00:21:37,440
love

308
00:21:37,500 --> 00:21:39,339
is about mutual willingness.

309
00:21:39,880 --> 00:21:40,880
You can't force it.

310
00:21:49,799 --> 00:21:50,700
Ye Pingjun.

311
00:21:54,200 --> 00:21:55,240
What am I supposed to do with you?

312
00:22:52,019 --> 00:22:52,819
Lieutenant Jiang.

313
00:22:53,039 --> 00:22:53,720
What's taking so long?

314
00:22:54,019 --> 00:22:54,660
Not done yet?

315
00:23:00,059 --> 00:23:00,759
Found it.

316
00:23:24,039 --> 00:23:25,539
How did I fall asleep?

317
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:28,960
Where's Xiaomu?

318
00:23:29,160 --> 00:23:29,880
I already took him back

319
00:23:29,880 --> 00:23:31,019
to the orphanage.

320
00:23:32,640 --> 00:23:33,440
Didn't expect you

321
00:23:34,339 --> 00:23:35,740
could sleep so soundly

322
00:23:36,019 --> 00:23:37,339
next to me, Miss Ye.

323
00:23:39,200 --> 00:23:41,460
Didn't you see yourself as a gentleman?

324
00:23:43,740 --> 00:23:44,660
Since when

325
00:23:45,339 --> 00:23:46,619
