326
00:24:05,680 --> 00:24:06,900
Thanks for driving me home.

327
00:24:07,319 --> 00:24:08,319
I'm heading in.

328
00:25:03,740 --> 00:25:04,660
Ye Pingjun.

329
00:25:05,839 --> 00:25:06,660
Pingjun!

330
00:25:12,539 --> 00:25:13,079
Xueting.

331
00:25:17,500 --> 00:25:18,240
General.

332
00:25:18,900 --> 00:25:19,839
It's so late.

333
00:25:20,539 --> 00:25:20,940
Why would you

334
00:25:20,940 --> 00:25:22,279
personally drive Pingjun home?

335
00:25:34,839 --> 00:25:35,579
Pingjun and I

336
00:25:35,859 --> 00:25:37,240
celebrated Xiaomu's birthday,

337
00:25:37,700 --> 00:25:38,900
went to the temple fair,

338
00:25:39,039 --> 00:25:40,160
and made clay figures.

339
00:25:45,819 --> 00:25:48,240
Zhang Yingmei said you had to work overtime.

340
00:25:48,740 --> 00:25:50,660
So Xiaomu reached out to Mr. Yu.

341
00:25:51,000 --> 00:25:52,960
That's how we ran into each other.

342
00:25:54,900 --> 00:25:56,400
General, you're so busy,

343
00:25:57,819 --> 00:25:58,839
yet you still drove her home.

344
00:25:59,519 --> 00:26:00,940
That's really too much trouble for you.

345
00:26:02,640 --> 00:26:03,539
You're one of my men.

346
00:26:04,240 --> 00:26:05,380
Your girlfriend

347
00:26:06,000 --> 00:26:07,160
is naturally...

348
00:26:15,940 --> 00:26:16,740
military family.

349
00:26:20,240 --> 00:26:21,660
It's only right I take good care of her.

350
00:26:23,880 --> 00:26:24,640
It's getting late.

351
00:26:25,880 --> 00:26:26,500
We

352
00:26:26,940 --> 00:26:27,779
won't invite you in

353
00:26:27,779 --> 00:26:28,759
for tea, General.

354
00:26:29,640 --> 00:26:30,660
No need for formalities

355
00:26:31,400 --> 00:26:32,400
between us.

356
00:26:48,000 --> 00:26:49,279
Let's head back.

357
00:27:14,579 --> 00:27:15,500
Morning, General.

358
00:27:18,240 --> 00:27:18,779
General.

359
00:27:20,500 --> 00:27:21,460
Could we talk somewhere in private?

360
00:27:27,380 --> 00:27:28,259
Lieutenant Jiang, just say

361
00:27:28,539 --> 00:27:29,500
what's on your mind.

362
00:27:31,579 --> 00:27:33,039
First, I want to thank you

363
00:27:33,319 --> 00:27:33,700
for celebrating

364
00:27:33,940 --> 00:27:35,700
the birthday with Pingjun and the kids.

365
00:27:36,319 --> 00:27:37,660
I should have been the one to show up.

366
00:27:38,180 --> 00:27:39,740
Didn't expect to get hit with overtime

367
00:27:40,079 --> 00:27:41,740
right before I clocked off.

368
00:27:42,740 --> 00:27:43,839
As long as the kids are happy.

369
00:27:44,319 --> 00:27:45,039
Don't give it a second thought.

370
00:27:45,740 --> 00:27:47,240
I just don't know if you

371
00:27:48,400 --> 00:27:49,779
really have a soft spot for children,

372
00:27:49,779 --> 00:27:50,400
or...

373
00:27:50,640 --> 00:27:52,039
if you've got some other motive.

374
00:27:55,319 --> 00:27:56,740
I'm not quite sure what you mean.

375
00:28:00,500 --> 00:28:01,740
I checked the duty log.

376
00:28:02,559 --> 00:28:03,519
The carbine translation

377
00:28:04,019 --> 00:28:04,980
was supposed to happen next week.

378
00:28:05,240 --> 00:28:06,539
I could've made it to the date.

379
00:28:08,220 --> 00:28:09,079
So you did that

380
00:28:09,619 --> 00:28:10,579
