386
00:28:30,140 --> 00:28:31,039
Not pull

387
00:28:31,759 --> 00:28:33,039
shady tricks

388
00:28:33,039 --> 00:28:34,200
behind someone's back.

389
00:28:41,240 --> 00:28:41,700
How well

390
00:28:41,700 --> 00:28:43,160
do you really know Ye Pingjun?

391
00:28:44,960 --> 00:28:46,579
You two grew up together.

392
00:28:46,740 --> 00:28:48,539
But is it love between a man and a woman,

393
00:28:49,900 --> 00:28:51,640
or just a friend's dependence?

394
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:54,940
Can you even tell?

395
00:29:07,039 --> 00:29:08,279
That's between her and me.

396
00:29:09,640 --> 00:29:10,240
General,

397
00:29:11,259 --> 00:29:11,819
you'd better take care

398
00:29:11,819 --> 00:29:12,779
