463
00:32:07,640 --> 00:32:08,940
No findings so far.

464
00:32:11,019 --> 00:32:11,759
Put more people on it.

465
00:32:12,000 --> 00:32:13,039
I want answers fast.

466
00:32:14,039 --> 00:32:14,579
Understood.

467
00:32:15,460 --> 00:32:16,339
And about the mine.

468
00:32:17,140 --> 00:32:18,539
It was registered as an iron mine,

469
00:32:18,900 --> 00:32:19,819
but it's actually a gold mine.

470
00:32:20,319 --> 00:32:21,039
By regulation,

471
00:32:21,299 --> 00:32:22,460
all locally mined gold

472
00:32:22,640 --> 00:32:23,779
must be handed over

473
00:32:23,779 --> 00:32:24,539
to the central government.

474
00:32:26,500 --> 00:32:28,519
Using soldiers' lives to pull off a cover-up.

475
00:32:30,160 --> 00:32:31,279
Some real nerve.

476
00:32:33,240 --> 00:32:33,980
Who was in charge?

477
00:32:34,299 --> 00:32:35,119
A man named Liao Tie.

478
00:32:35,519 --> 00:32:36,720
He looks ordinary,

479
00:32:37,880 --> 00:32:38,940
but he's Feng Sanli's

480
00:32:38,940 --> 00:32:39,640
distant nephew.

481
00:32:44,799 --> 00:32:46,460
Changxuan, Feng Sanli...

482
00:32:46,500 --> 00:32:47,059
Arrest him!

483
00:32:47,940 --> 00:32:48,519
Yes, sir!

484
00:32:50,819 --> 00:32:51,359
Slander.

485
00:32:52,099 --> 00:32:53,039
Nothing but slander!

486
00:32:53,339 --> 00:32:54,019
I

487
00:32:54,140 --> 00:32:55,539
may have a temper,

488
00:32:56,299 --> 00:32:57,400
but I'm no coward!

489
00:32:58,059 --> 00:32:59,740
Gold mine? Iron mine?

490
00:33:00,740 --> 00:33:02,240
None of it has anything to do with me.

491
00:33:03,599 --> 00:33:04,579
Feng Sanli,

492
00:33:06,440 --> 00:33:07,279
don't waste

493
00:33:07,279 --> 00:33:08,339
the chance I'm giving you.

494
00:33:09,200 --> 00:33:10,160
I'll say one thing.

495
00:33:11,119 --> 00:33:12,720
I didn't do it.

496
00:33:16,559 --> 00:33:17,980
Soldiers were taken from your barracks

497
00:33:18,380 --> 00:33:19,660
onto military trucks.

498
00:33:21,500 --> 00:33:22,900
The man in charge of the mine

499
00:33:23,900 --> 00:33:25,019
is your distant nephew.

500
00:33:25,819 --> 00:33:27,559
And there are handwritten suicide notes

501
00:33:27,559 --> 00:33:28,980
from the soldiers who died in the mine.

502
00:33:31,660 --> 00:33:33,160
And you're still denying it?

503
00:33:36,700 --> 00:33:37,980
You keep claiming

504
00:33:37,980 --> 00:33:39,240
you're loyal

505
00:33:39,519 --> 00:33:42,140
to my father and the Yu Army.

506
00:33:44,019 --> 00:33:45,519
But everything you've done

507
00:33:45,900 --> 00:33:46,880
has pushed them

508
00:33:46,880 --> 00:33:48,339
into the crossfire

509
00:33:48,740 --> 00:33:50,339
and put their lives on the line.

510
00:33:51,259 --> 00:33:53,299
Is this what you call loyalty?

511
00:33:56,119 --> 00:33:57,420
You say I pocketed the gold mine.

512
00:33:58,259 --> 00:33:59,299
No loot, no thief‌.

513
00:33:59,960 --> 00:34:00,759
Where's the loot?

514
00:34:02,000 --> 00:34:02,920
Is there any loot?

515
00:34:04,839 --> 00:34:05,779
I never personally ordered

516
00:34:06,039 --> 00:34:07,819
the use of military vehicles.

517
00:34:08,139 --> 00:34:09,860
He's just a distant nephew of mine.

518
00:34:10,460 --> 00:34:11,519
A relative

519
00:34:11,519 --> 00:34:12,500
barely worth mentioning.

520
00:34:12,840 --> 00:34:14,179
Now that things have gone wrong,

521
00:34:14,579 --> 00:34:16,000
he insists on dragging me into it.

522
00:34:16,380 --> 00:34:18,219
Even if the central government comes,

523
00:34:18,860 --> 00:34:20,340
they can't throw me in prison

524
00:34:20,340 --> 00:34:21,460
without evidence.

525
00:34:25,460 --> 00:34:26,219
Young Master,

526
00:34:27,039 --> 00:34:27,980
let me ask you,

527
00:34:29,340 --> 00:34:32,019
do you and the general trust an outsider,

528
00:34:32,679 --> 00:34:33,880
or a man who's

529
00:34:33,880 --> 00:34:36,139
fought tooth and nail for the Yu Army

530
00:34:36,139 --> 00:34:37,179
and still carries

531
00:34:37,179 --> 00:34:39,179
27 bullet wounds

532
00:34:39,260 --> 00:34:40,900
on his body?

533
00:34:50,679 --> 00:34:51,900
Give us justice!

534
00:34:52,460 --> 00:34:53,679
Give us justice!

535
00:34:54,019 --> 00:34:55,380
Hand over the culprit!

536
00:34:55,699 --> 00:34:57,320
Hand over the culprit!

537
00:34:57,320 --> 00:34:58,619
Give us justice!

538
00:34:58,900 --> 00:35:00,340
Give us justice!

539
00:35:00,340 --> 00:35:01,860
Hand over the culprit!

540
00:35:01,940 --> 00:35:03,239
Hand over the culprit!

541
00:35:03,760 --> 00:35:05,079
Hand over the culprit!

542
00:35:05,199 --> 00:35:06,579
Give us justice!

543
00:35:06,589 --> 00:35:08,019
Give us justice!

544
00:35:08,079 --> 00:35:08,940
Hand over the culprit!

545
00:35:09,659 --> 00:35:10,719
Hand over the culprit!

546
00:35:12,199 --> 00:35:13,519
This has gone way too far!

547
00:35:13,900 --> 00:35:15,039
Right now, all the blame

548
00:35:15,139 --> 00:35:16,400
is pointed at Father and Changxuan.

549
00:35:16,420 --> 00:35:17,920
They're being painted as monsters.

550
00:35:18,840 --> 00:35:19,739
Our wounded soldiers

551
00:35:19,900 --> 00:35:21,260
get taken in at dedicated hospitals.

552
00:35:21,539 --> 00:35:22,599
And free treatment.

553
00:35:22,840 --> 00:35:24,099
How could we ever mistreat soldiers?

554
00:35:24,139 --> 00:35:25,880
The Army has tens of thousands of men.

555
00:35:26,139 --> 00:35:26,820
How can we say

556
00:35:26,820 --> 00:35:27,780
there are no bad apples

557
00:35:27,780 --> 00:35:28,719
abusing their power?

558
00:35:29,619 --> 00:35:31,639
We have to trust your father and Changxuan.

559
00:35:32,179 --> 00:35:34,079
They'll definitely track down

560
00:35:34,079 --> 00:35:35,579
the rotten apple fast.

561
00:35:36,960 --> 00:35:38,900
Mother, we can't just wait for

562
00:35:38,900 --> 00:35:40,460
Father and Changxuan to clear their names.

563
00:35:40,840 --> 00:35:42,139
I have an idea.

564
00:35:42,639 --> 00:35:43,739
We ladies

565
00:35:43,739 --> 00:35:44,860
can go visit the wounded soldiers

566
00:35:44,860 --> 00:35:45,920
at the military hospital.

567
00:35:46,000 --> 00:35:47,860
First, it steadies the troops.

568
00:35:48,199 --> 00:35:49,880
If we really mistreated soldiers,

569
00:35:50,119 --> 00:35:51,360
we wouldn't have this kind of guts

570
00:35:51,360 --> 00:35:52,179
and clean conscience.

571
00:35:53,440 --> 00:35:55,699
Second, it sets an example,

572
00:35:56,000 --> 00:35:57,980
showing that we stand shoulder to shoulder

573
00:35:58,380 --> 00:35:59,380
with all our soldiers,

574
00:35:59,800 --> 00:36:01,139
and have never drifted apart.

575
00:36:01,860 --> 00:36:02,619
But

576
00:36:03,039 --> 00:36:04,579
what if people say

577
00:36:06,179 --> 00:36:07,260
we're just putting on a show?

578
00:36:08,139 --> 00:36:09,840
Justice speaks for itself.

579
00:36:10,260 --> 00:36:11,159
We meant to

580
00:36:11,159 --> 00:36:13,300
look after the wounded soldiers.

581
00:36:13,500 --> 00:36:15,360
We don't care about gossip.

582
00:36:15,719 --> 00:36:17,039
We're sticking to

583
00:36:17,840 --> 00:36:19,460
what we've always done.‌

584
00:36:19,719 --> 00:36:21,639
Going together to visit the wounded

585
00:36:21,940 --> 00:36:24,400
